ess any thioredoxin activity since it lacks the conserved motif that is essential for catalytic activity."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}